<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS1" title="In Appendix C Further Analysis ‣ IR3D-Bench: Evaluating Vision-Language Model Scene Understanding as Agentic Inverse Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.1 </span>Limitation</span></a></li>
