<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">IR3D-Bench: Evaluating Vision-Language Model Scene Understanding as Agentic Inverse Rendering</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Parker Liu
